Static binaries

blkid and eject: util-linux 2.42.4, https://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/util-linux/v2.42/
Source archive SHA256: fbd62a100ab7bb8746ba0661255c3c48185b1e9021507c624da01fbc696330ec
Build with sh tools/build-initramfs-tools on Linux using musl-tools:i386,
musl-dev:i386 and linux-libc-dev-i386-cross. Both executables are stripped,
static i686 ELF files with no shared-library or interpreter dependencies.
The build verifies the pinned upstream archive and the resulting ELF properties.

