mount.dynfilefs: DynFileFS 6.02, https://github.com/Tomas-M/dynfilefs (GNU GPL).
Built from commit 72389fb with per-point reclaimableBytes, runtime autosnapshot
control, ID-based image paths and renaming with international names and spaces.
Use the project's static/build.sh: musl i686, -Os, stripped and UPX-packed.
